#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_1
Man: Hello there, kid!\nHave I got a deal just for you!\pI'll let you have a secret Pok\emon\n- a [GREEN]Magikarp[BLUE] - for just \$500!\pSo, you'll buy it, am I right?

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_Reject
No? You say no? I'm only doing this\nas a favor to you!

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_MoreMoney
You'll need more money than that!

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_Bought1
[BLACK][PLAYER] paid an outrageous \$500\nand bought the [GREEN]Magikarp[.][BLUE]

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_2
Man: Hah! My favorite kid!\pCouldn't get enough of [GREEN]Magikarp[BLUE],\nhuh?\pYou want another one for \$75000,\ndon't you?

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_Bought2
[BLACK][PLAYER], again, paid an outrageous\n\$75000 and bought the [GREEN]Magikarp[.][BLUE]

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_AfterBought2
Ha ha ha! What a score!\pThanks for the business, ya idiot!

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_3
Ha ha ha! My favorite kid!\pI scammed you out of \$75000 with\nthat defective [GREEN]Magikarp[BLUE]!

#org @gText_MagikarpGuy_4
[.]That was a Shiny?!\pYou're kidding!\p[.]Can I have it back? Please? 

#org @gText_givepoweruppunch_3
It's always important to work on self-\nimprovement!\pAfter all, there is always\nroom to grow stronger!

#org @gText_givepoweruppunch_4
You agree, don't you?!

#org @gText_givepoweruppunch_5
That's what I like to hear champ!\pI'd be happy to give you this!

#org @gText_givepoweruppunch_7
Each punch makes you stronger!\nKeep pushing it!

#org @gText_givepoweruppunch_6
Wimp!

#org @gText_machobrace_3
Sorry, my partner can be a bit\nfeisty.\pBut, if you're serious about training,\ntake this.

#org @gText_machobrace_4
[GREEN]Macho Brace [BLUE]is great for\nspeeding up EV training.

#org @gText_machobrace_4_2
[GREEN]PP Ups [BLUE]can be great for moves\nwith low Power Points.

#org @gText_machobrace_5
[.]You don't know what EV training is?\nDo you even Smogon bro?

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_1
[BLUE]What in the world[.]

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_Suchpower
[BLUE]Such power!\pHe forced us out of his domain[.]

#org @gText_DaycareWinbattle

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_2
[BLUE]And he broke out of my ball!\pHa ha ha!\pNow I've seen everything!

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_3
[BLUE]Perhaps my Master Ball was\ndefective[.]\pBut, more importantly,\n[GREEN]Mewtwo[BLUE] deemed me unworthy.\pAnd[.]

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_4
[BLUE]It spoke to you!\pPerhaps he's awaiting for you to\nbecome champion?\pThat was truly a once in a life-\ntime experience.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_5
[BLUE]It's time I turned it around.\pWith the strength my loyal admins\nand I have, we could definitely make\la legitimate living.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_6
[BLUE]I don't know if my son would\never forgive me[.]\pBut it's never too late to\nstart an honest life.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_6_2 
[GREEN]Lance: [BLUE]Giovanni, I have no\nidea if it's possible for you to\lright your wrongs, but I do believe\lin giving people second chances.\pI hope to see better things out of\nyou.\pI, on behalf of the Pok\emon League,\nwill be keeping a close eye on\lyou[.]

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_7
[GREEN]Giovanni:[BLUE] Right, of course[.]\nYou have my word.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_7_2
[BLUE]Anyway[.]\pThis feels right in your hands.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_8
[GREEN]Archer, Ariana[BLUE][.]\pI'm indebted to both of you.\pTo new beginnings!

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_9
[BLUE]Yes sir!!

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_10
[BLUE]Thank you, [GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE].\pWe hope to meet you again\nwhen you're the champion!

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_11
[BLUE]I deeply apologize for everything.\pIt's an empty apology,\nI know.\pBut, take care of yourself,\n[GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE].\pI've handed my position as Gym\nLeader to someone else already.\pAnd if you run into [GREEN]Silver[BLUE][.]

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_12
[BLUE]Tell him I'm sorry.\pFarewell.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_13
[BLUE]Well, wasn't that a strange turn\nof events. Perhaps it would've been\lwise to not let him go, but[.]\pI do get the feel he came to\nhis senses.\pPerhaps I'm naive.

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_14
[BLUE]But anyway, thank you for assisting\nme today.\pHere, I have this to offer you. 

#org @gText_postgiovannilevelscript_15
[BLUE]And he did mention the name [GREEN]Silver[BLUE][.]\pI've actually ran into that kid\na couple of times!\pHe was once a snotty brat, but he's\nturned into a formidable trainer.\pHe does resemble his father quite\na bit.\pAnyway, take care [GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE].\nI'll see you in the Pok\emon\lLeague soon.

#org @gText_route3carepackage
[BLUE]Whew[.] I better take a rest[.]\nGroan[.]\pThat tunnel from [GREEN]Cerulean[BLUE] takes a\nlot out of you!

#org @gText_route3careaskcare
[BLUE]Ah, would you like a care\npackage?

#org @gText_Daycare_Eevee1
[BLUE]Ah, hello there trainer.\pBack in my younger days, I\nwas quite the talented trainer,\ltravelling across all regions\land taking on many formidable\lopponents.\pNow, I simply help out here at the\ndaycare.\pBut, I want a feeling of that rush\nagain!\pI have some powerful Pok\emon\nI'll let you borrow if you'd like\lto entertain me for a bit.\pShall we?

#org @gText_Daycare_EeveeDontFight
[BLUE]I know I know, you kiddos\nalways have something to do[.]

#org @gText_Daycare_Eevee2
[BLUE]I can already feel the thrill\ncoming back!

#org @gText_DaycareLoseBattle
Whoo! I still got it!

#org @gText_DaycareWinBattle
Hah, well played.

#org @gText_Daycare_Eevee2_Lose
Thank you for the opportunity\nyoung one.\pIf you show you can beat me,\nI have a prize ready.

#org @gText_Daycare_Eevee3
What a wonderful fight.\pIt definitely brought back\nsome memories, good and\lbad[.]\pThose Pok\emon I have are\nHisuian Pok\emon.\pThey are fairly rare in the\nKanto Region, but I've heard\lreports of them on the Sevii\lIslands.\pAnywho, I'd like you to have\nthis for defeating me.

#org @gText_Daycare_ReceivedEevee
[BLACK]You received an [GREEN]Eevee!

#org @gText_Daycare_Eevee4
Continue travelling and find-\ning new unique strategies.\pThis is how I became a\nstronger trainer.
